      "side": 1,
      "message": "What happens if a guest dies when some of its pages are shared with the hypervisor? The logic in `__pkvm_host_reclaim_page` doesn\u0027t look like it will handle the page poisoning or the PSCI `mem_protect` counter properly in that case, as it only looks at the page state.",
