      "side": 1,
      "message": "I introduce `kvm_reclaim_ffa_guest_pages` later on this series which is called from the `pvm_start_teardown` hvc. This function gives the pages back to the guest owned state so that the host reclaim can do its thing.\n\nThe link can be found here: 3365082: ANDROID: KVM: On guest exit ask Trustzone to relinquish the borrowed pages | https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/kernel/common/+/3365082",
